extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 18: Mystic Russia pp.68-69, read from the text layer. IMPORTED UNDER D4. NO xp_table, per D3. THIS ENTRY BREAKS THE PATTERN THE OTHER FIVE FOLLOW: it puts Prowl in its R.C.C. SKILLS line rather than under Natural Abilities, so Prowl is granted here as a catalog skill at 70% while the Domovoi''s, Leshii''s and Polevoi''s prowl percentages stay as prose. The seam is the book''s, not this import''s, and it is why the decision is written down in every one of these six files rather than assumed. ITS PSIONIC LINE IS WORD FOR WORD THE VODIANOI''S - ''M.E. x2 for I.S.P. Psi-powers include: Mind Block, Exorcism, Telepathy, and Hydrokinesis'' - which gives a land wolf the water-moving Super psionic Hydrokinesis. That reads like a copy-paste in the book rather than a design decision, and it is transcribed AS PRINTED because a plausible correction is still an invention; a later pass wanting to change it should change it deliberately. Note the catalog files Hydrokinesis under Super, not Physical, and the class states no psionics.type, so it takes the tier a character would otherwise have - the same shape the Gargoyle uses. mdc_base is ''6D6x3'', one of only two flat M.D.C. formulas among the six (the rest are P.E. plus dice). The magic list prints ''Repell Animals'' with two Ls; the catalog row is Repel Animals and that is what is granted. THE SPEED IS THE HIGHEST IN THE BOOK: 3D6+118, a minimum of 82 mph, and it can hold it for 72 hours. The text layer carries this book''s digit cipher: the P.P.E. line prints ''3D4xlO'' and the S.D.C.-world line ''!D6xlO''."
